WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.853 --> 00:00:07.559
Tap "Upload a floor plan" and choose an image.

2
00:00:08.059 --> 00:00:13.760
The app reads the rooms, doors and windows.

3
00:00:14.260 --> 00:00:21.612
Check the rooms and set the scale with a dimension you know.

4
00:00:22.112 --> 00:00:39.828
Or place the plan under your drawing and trace over it.

5
00:00:40.328 --> 00:00:46.033
Then re-measure what matters.

6
00:00:46.483 --> 00:00:51.333
In this video the AI's reply is simulated.

